<title>Pima County - November 3, 2026 General Election | Citizens Clean Elections Commission</title>

<br />


<h2>November 3, 2026 - Statewide General Elections</h2>
<div class="shade">
<table class="grid">
<thead><tr><th>Location</th><th class="nw">Election Type</th><th>What's on the Ballot</th></tr></thead>
