<div class="box shadow">
<div style="text-align:left;">

<span class="bright">PIMA COUNTY</span>
<h3>Contact Information</h3>
<div class="table" style="width:100%;">
<p><b>County Recorder</b><br />Gabriella Cázares-Kelly<br />240 North Stone Avenue<br />Tucson, AZ 85701<br />520-724-4330<br />T.D.D. 520-724-4320<br /> <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#dbfbadb4afbea99ba9beb8b4a9bfbea9f5abb2b6baf5bcb4ad"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="b3c5dcc7d6c1f3c1d6d0dcc1d7d6c19dc3daded29dd4dcc5">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> <br /><br /><a href="https://www.recorder.pima.gov/RecorderHome" class="button yellow" target="_blank">Go to Website</a></p>


